  "content": "<p data-pid=\"sOWJlmas\"><b>《将心智模型付诸实践的框架》</b>是一个系列文集，旨在探讨如何在生活中真正地运用「<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//fs.blog/mental-models/%3Fref%3Dcommoncog.com\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">心智模型</a>」，以求习得更卓越的决策能力。</p><p data-pid=\"ry_ZUPE-\">本系列所呈现的观点，是对理性研究、决策科学、应用心理学及古典认识论的一次深入导览。我开发此框架的初衷，是为自己追求个人目标时，能有一个用于提升决策与判断能力的理论架构。</p><p data-pid=\"PZg1tVuw\">本系列最初为 <a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//fs.blog/membership/%3Fref%3Dcommoncog.com\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">Farnam Street 学习社区</a>撰写并发表，同时也是对我此前在《<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//commoncog.com/the-mental-model-fallacy/\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">心智模型的谬误</a><sup data-text=\"心智模型的谬误\" data-url=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2019791395712448412\" data-draft-node=\"inline\" data-draft-type=\"reference\" data-numero=\"1\">[1]</sup>》一文中所提批评的一份建设性回应。</p><p data-pid=\"vOUugYw9\">若您时间有限或暂无兴趣阅读全文，可参阅简短的摘要文章：<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//commoncog.com/the-mental-model-faq/\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">心智模型常见问题解答</a><sup data-text=\"心智模型常见问题解答\" data-url=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2019791563983700307\" data-draft-node=\"inline\" data-draft-type=\"reference\" data-numero=\"2\">[2]</sup>。</p><ol><li data-pid=\"wNTumezH\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//commoncog.com/a-framework-for-putting-mental-models-to-practice-part-1/\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">芒格的演讲</a><sup data-text=\"将心智模型付诸实践的框架（一）：芒格的演讲\" data-url=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1964071787571713115\" data-draft-node=\"inline\" data-draft-type=\"reference\" data-numero=\"3\">[3]</sup></li><li data-pid=\"4BFD6Fdy\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//commoncog.com/putting-mental-models-to-practice-part-2-introduction-to-rationality/\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">理性思维入门</a><sup data-text=\"将心智模型付诸实践（二）：理性导论\" data-url=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1969405487754739808\" data-draft-node=\"inline\" data-draft-type=\"reference\" data-numero=\"4\">[4]</sup></li><li data-pid=\"Ty0-8HJ6\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//commoncog.com/putting-mental-models-to-practice-part-3-better-trial-and-error/\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">更好的试错法</a><sup data-text=\"将心智模型付诸实践（三）：更好的试错法\" data-url=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1973360091374851286\" data-draft-node=\"inline\" data-draft-type=\"reference\" data-numero=\"5\">[5]</sup></li><li data-pid=\"-sLgV8iE\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//commoncog.com/putting-mental-models-to-practice/\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">专家的决策之道</a><sup data-text=\"将心智模型付诸实践（四）：专家决策\" data-url=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1981679557133243066\" data-draft-node=\"inline\" data-draft-type=\"reference\" data-numero=\"6\">[6]</sup></li><li data-pid=\"L47rIPHq\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//commoncog.com/putting-mental-models-to-practice-part-5-skill-extraction/\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">萃取专家技能</a><sup data-text=\"将心智模型付诸实践（五）：技能提取\" data-url=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1992962400983478398\" data-draft-node=\"inline\" data-draft-type=\"reference\" data-numero=\"7\">[7]</sup></li><li data-pid=\"aSFKc_dD\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//commoncog.com/putting-mental-models-to-practice-part-6-a-personal-epistemology-of-practice/\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">构建个人的实践认识论</a><sup data-text=\"将心智模型付诸实践（六）：一种关于实践的个人认识论\" data-url=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2005692610090660553\" data-draft-node=\"inline\" data-draft-type=\"reference\" data-numero=\"8\">[8]</sup></li></ol><hr/><blockquote data-pid=\"4M74ZBPv\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=http%3A//paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 gemini-3.1-pro-preview，校对 Jarrett Ye<br/>作者：<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//commoncog.com/author/cedric/\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">Cedric Chin</a><br/>原文：<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//commoncog.com/a-framework-for-putting-mental-models-to-practice/\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">A Framework for Putting Mental Models to Practice - Commoncog</a>、<br/>最初发布于 2018 年 12 月 25 日，最后更新于 2023 年 6 月 13 日</blockquote>",
